WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Sit with knees bent, feet on the floor, hands behind the thighs.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Lean back slightly and lift the feet, shins parallel to the floor.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
If steady, straighten the legs toward a V shape.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Reach the arms forward and lift the chest.
